      "summary": "The investigation has established a single causal branch: incomplete boundary preparation (unsiged acceptance) coexisted with an air supply interruption whose origin remains unknown. Evidence supports that the crew was in 'boundary preparation' status but does not confirm whether they saw recent changes or used outdated drawings, nor does it establish if an unrecorded service-routing change occurred.",
